g</h2><div><h3>CursorBench 3.1</h3><ul><li>Introduced problems focused on codebase understanding, bugfinding, planning, and code review.</li><li>Improved grading criteria for some edit tasks.</li></ul></div><div><h3>CursorBench 3.0</h3><ul><li>Initial set of tasks focused on edit, refactor, and bugfix problems.</li></ul></div></section><p>Avg cost / task is computed by applying each model's published<!-- --> <a href=\"https://cursor.com/docs/models-and-pricing\">per-million-token pricing</a> <!-- -->(input, cache read, cache write, and output) to the tokens it used on each CursorBench 3.1 task, then averaging across tasks. Results are subject to variance; small differences in scores may not be statistically meaningful.</p></div></div>",
